{"id":122055,"vol":{"id":796,"name":"Batman"},"num":"650","name":"All They Do Is Watch Us Kill, Part 3 of 3: It Only Hurts When I Laugh","title":"Batman #650","year":"2006","date":"2006-04-01","store":"2006-02-22","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/3125/292818-796-122055-1-batman.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/3125/292818-796-122055-1-batman.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"In the thrilling conclusion to this story arc. Batman attempts to leave the scene and head to Bludhaven to search for Dick, but to no avail, as Jason refuses to let him leave. It's Batman vs. Jason vs. Joker as Jason gives Batman the ultimate Ultimatum; Kill the Joker or Kill him. This is the last Batman story before the DCU jumps ahead 1 year. Don't miss this terrific ending!","people":[{"id":9587,"name":"Alex Sinclair","role":"colorist"},{"id":41760,"name":"Bob Schreck","role":"editor"},{"id":51578,"name":"Brandon Montclare","role":"editor"},{"id":22901,"name":"Eric Battle","role":"penciler"},{"id":5653,"name":"Jock","role":"cover"},{"id":10383,"name":"Judd Winick","role":"writer"},{"id":41785,"name":"Pat Brosseau","role":"letterer"},{"id":4374,"name":"Rodney Ramos","role":"inker"}],"chars":[{"id":1699,"name":"Batman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11144/111442876/8759934-jrjrhr.jpg"},{"id":1702,"name":"Joker","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11156/111564182/10110910-latest.jpg"},{"id":6849,"name":"Jason Todd","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11156/111564182/9829248-c67adm0250jf1.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":56274,"name":"\"Batman\" Under the Hood"}]}